                    <msContents>
                        <summary>A list of 22 therapeutic uses of Cabalonga, probably Strychmos spp.
                            A Recepta de la Pepita de Covalonga was published in Mexico in 1730, probably by Jose Bernardo de Hoga
                            (at the same time as his Virtudes de la piedra quadrada. [See M.40; and see Medina (Mex.), iv, J146, Jr 55, 
                            and Gazeta de Mexico,1730, num. 32, p. 255 (July)]. 
                            
                            
                            <note>[Endorsed:] Virtudes de las Pepitas de Cabalonga
                                [Headed:] Para lo q[ue) sirven las Pepitas q[ue]Haman Ysagur, V[ara] de S[a)n Ygn[acio). = Y Cabalonga.</note>
                            
                            <note>Upon cataloguing, the original author was not apparent</note>
                            
                        </summary>
                        
                        <textLang mainLang="es" source="IANA">Spanish</textLang>
                        
